0..68 Comment "//! `resumed` gives a cancellation that resumes a task continuation."
69..72 Comment "//!"
73..245 Comment "//! The exit clause resumes the rest of its scope once. The resumed continuation reads the task end exactly once. The resumed continuation closes the task end exactly once."
246..249 Comment "//!"
250..384 Comment "//! The handler starts a task. The task sends its note. The task closes. The exit operation resumes the continuation before a receive."
385..388 Comment "//!"
389..419 Comment "//! - see: #1334 — `resumed`"
